{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "dbc8smoogyq7ig49", "title": "26.一节课讲透分布式session一致性问题", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"adapt\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u15cd6e53\" id=\"u15cd6e53\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d4a6487\" id=\"u3d4a6487\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u13744c17\" id=\"u13744c17\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fppt%2F2424104%2F1717594440824-f85d0f1b-e327-437e-86cf-5f829e394bbf.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22session-demo.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A139818%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud203519c-aab6-4cce-810d-1aa77bbec66%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u106dfc75%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u39953cf7\" id=\"u39953cf7\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6a7ac0cc\" id=\"u6a7ac0cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub68a723b\" id=\"ub68a723b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">jdk版本：1.8.0_181</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub98c8d02\" id=\"ub98c8d02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u37d930ed\" id=\"u37d930ed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ucbd84969\" id=\"ucbd84969\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubf9eaec1\" id=\"ubf9eaec1\">本次分享内容</span></strong></p><ol list=\"uf3985cd8\"><li fid=\"uaacafda0\" data-lake-id=\"u82df881d\" id=\"u82df881d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19ab2ef2\" id=\"u19ab2ef2\">什么是session一致性问题?</span></li><li fid=\"uaacafda0\" data-lake-id=\"u9f47f130\" id=\"u9f47f130\"><span data-lake-id=\"u39c53a44\" id=\"u39c53a44\">常见session一致性解决方案</span></li><li fid=\"uaacafda0\" data-lake-id=\"u89603d90\" id=\"u89603d90\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue337607f\" id=\"ue337607f\">基于Redis实现session共享方案</span></li><li fid=\"uaacafda0\" data-lake-id=\"ub420d242\" id=\"ub420d242\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f0c6a82\" id=\"u5f0c6a82\">总结</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"irmnb\" id=\"irmnb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42a21f8e\" id=\"u42a21f8e\">1. 什么是session一致性问题?</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"LRPGm\" id=\"LRPGm\"><span data-lake-id=\"udebc227a\" id=\"udebc227a\">1.1 什么是session?</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub0cee100\" id=\"ub0cee100\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfb42687\" id=\"udfb42687\">Session 是服务器用来保存用户操作的一系列会话信息，由Web容器进行管理。最常见的，会把用户的登录信息、用户信息存储在 session 中，以保持登录状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud7348a1c\" id=\"ud7348a1c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf101eeda\" id=\"uf101eeda\">Cookie技术是http状态保持在客户端的解决方案，Cookie就是由服务器发给客户端的特殊信息，而这些信息以文本文件的方式存放在客户端，然后客户端每次向服务器发送请求的时候都会带上这些特殊的信息。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u775db05f\" id=\"u775db05f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uded35651\" id=\"uded35651\">cookie的内容主要包括：名字，值，过期时间，路径和域。路径与域合在一起就构成了cookie的作用范围。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"YZUzQ\" id=\"YZUzQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5afa3f5e\" id=\"u5afa3f5e\">1.2 session的创建</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u50154c76\" id=\"u50154c76\"><span data-lake-id=\"u05ca488d\" id=\"u05ca488d\">在会话开始时，分配一个唯一的会话标识 SessionID（sessionid 是一个会话的key，浏览器第一次访问服务器会在服务器端生成一个 session，有一个 sessionId 和它对应。），并通过 Cookie 将这个标识告诉浏览器（客户端会将 sessionID 保存在 cookie 中。），以后每次请求的时候，浏览器都会带上这个会话标识SessionID来告诉Web服务器这个请求是属于哪个会话的。在Web服务器上，各个会话都有独立的存储，保存不同会话的信息。如果遇到禁用Cookie的情况，一般的做法就是把这个会话标识放到URL的参数中。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"aZ0y7\" id=\"aZ0y7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u881915f9\" id=\"u881915f9\">1.3 session一致性问题</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u06b91689\" id=\"u06b91689\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb059655\" id=\"ucb059655\">分布式情况下，如果每台服务器都session存在自己的内存中，不同服务器之间就会造成数据不一致问题，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8ced3145\" id=\"u8ced3145\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a9622a3\" id=\"u5a9622a3\">这时候就需要session共享。单机情况下，不存在Session共享的情况。分布式情况下，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3249c701\" id=\"u3249c701\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae5d21f0\" id=\"uae5d21f0\">如果不进行Session共享会出现数据不一致，比如：会导致请求落到不同服务器要重复登录的情况。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7c2022cb\" id=\"u7c2022cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4793c81b\" id=\"u4793c81b\">只要用户不重启浏览器，每次http短连接请求，理论上服务端都能定位到session，保持会话。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4554c390\" id=\"u4554c390\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"GkCDn\" id=\"GkCDn\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc17bf897\" id=\"uc17bf897\">2. 常见session一致性解决方案</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"alUuG\" id=\"alUuG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1de2db31\" id=\"u1de2db31\">2.1 session同步</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9b112dab\" id=\"u9b112dab\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ef9f461\" id=\"u4ef9f461\">思路：多个web-server之间相互同步session，这样每个web-server之间都包含全部的session<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ub90c6592\" id=\"ub90c6592\">优点：web-server支持的功能，应用程序不需要修改代码<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ub5f151d8\" id=\"ub5f151d8\">不足：session的同步需要数据传输，占内网带宽，有时延<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u73eb0b00\" id=\"u73eb0b00\">所有web-server都包含所有session数据，数据量受内存限制，无法水平扩展，有更多web-server时要歇菜</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf757b017\" id=\"uf757b017\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1717489239385-138e3089-ce0c-4c5f-b267-1cac93d0c086.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u66fc0e62-ae14-4c9e-96cd-f875f400340%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u013bf0b1-2ad1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A407.3999938964844%2C%22height%22%3A295%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A21667%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A478%2C%22originHeight%22%3A346%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%2FAPP%22%2C%22x%22%3A173%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A81%22%2C%22x%22%3A58%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A82%22%2C%22x%22%3A308%2C%22y%22%3A263%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SESSION%22%2C%22x%22%3A323%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A62%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SESSION%22%2C%22x%22%3A80%2C%22y%22%3A308%2C%22width%22%3A58%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NGINX%22%2C%22x%22%3A206%2C%22y%22%3A134%2C%22width%22%3A47%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A214%2C%22y%22%3A236%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2d84f926%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub245e3c7\" id=\"ub245e3c7\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22%25E6%25B5%2581%25E7%25A8%258B%25E5%259B%25BE%255Csession%25E5%2590%258C%25E6%25AD%25A5.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22IQknV%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"El1eU\" id=\"El1eU\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c44067d\" id=\"u6c44067d\">2.2 客户端存储法</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud4edc86f\" id=\"ud4edc86f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68ef471b\" id=\"u68ef471b\">思路：服务端存储所有用户的session，内存占用较大，可以将session存储到浏览器cookie中，每个端只要存储一个用户的数据了<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u6fbb29f3\" id=\"u6fbb29f3\">优点：服务端不需要存储<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"uef8ab8ef\" id=\"uef8ab8ef\">不足：每次http请求都携带session，占外网带宽<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"uce3f74b6\" id=\"uce3f74b6\">数据存储在端上，并在网络传输，存在泄漏、篡改、窃取等安全隐患<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"ucd0b13c2\" id=\"ucd0b13c2\">session存储的数据大小受cookie限制</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud759e6d8\" id=\"ud759e6d8\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1717489250664-e5fe4ca9-82a0-45fa-829b-6cc66cb97b26.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc8d99b93-840e-41db-a822-37a68e047c5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u013bf0b1-2ad1-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A408.8000183105469%2C%22height%22%3A322%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A15909%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A446%2C%22originHeight%22%3A351%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%2FAPP%22%2C%22x%22%3A162%2C%22y%22%3A59%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A81%22%2C%22x%22%3A47%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WEB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%99%A82%22%2C%22x%22%3A292%2C%22y%22%3A287%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NGINX%22%2C%22x%22%3A197%2C%22y%22%3A159%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SESSION%22%2C%22x%22%3A190%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2514595a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22%25E6%25B5%2581%25E7%25A8%258B%25E5%259B%25BE%255C%25E5%25AE%25A2%25E6%2588%25B7%25E7%25AB%25AF%25E5%25AD%2598%25E5%2582%25A8%25E6%25B3%2595.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22YXeFc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ExFHC\" id=\"ExFHC\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc2720f0\" id=\"ufc2720f0\">2.3 反向代理hash一致性</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u9b8d7add\" id=\"u9b8d7add\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0fe1705c\" id=\"u0fe1705c\">思路：反向代理使用http协议中的某些业务属性来做hash，例如sid，city_id，user_id等，能够更加灵活的实施hash策略，以保证同一个浏览器用户的请求落在同一个web-server上<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u965d3cb2\" id=\"u965d3cb2\">优点：只需要改nginx配置，不需要修改应用代码<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u4a5d4266\" id=\"u4a5d4266\">负载均衡，只要hash属性是均匀的，多台web-server的负载是均衡的<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u1fbaf5de\" id=\"u1fbaf5de\">可以支持web-server水平扩展（session同步法是不行的，受内存限制）<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u40cb25e5\" id=\"u40cb25e5\">不足：如果web-server重启，一部分session会丢失，产生业务影响，例如部分用户重新登录<br /></span><span data-lake-id=\"u2b1abeff\" id=\"u2b1abeff\">如果web-server水平扩展，rehash后session重新分布，也会有一部分用户路由不到正确的session</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf36ec042\" id=\"uf36ec042\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22%25E6%25B5%2581%25E7%25A8%258B%25E5%259B%25BE%255C%25E5%258F%258D%25E5%2590%2591%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E7%2590%2586hash%25E4%25B8%2580%25E8%2587%25B4%25E6%2580%25A7.png%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ug1dh%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1717489266043-7adc337b-5bf7-4479-b4b7-7a525e493aed.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u50bcc302-c7f5-